    "content_descriptors": {
        "ids": [
            5
        ],
        "notes": "Intended for Mature Audiences \u2013 Contains disturbing themes and intense moments.\r\n\r\nA relentless stalking entity that chases the player through environments. High-tension escape sequences with limited resources.\r\nDecaying corpses and unsettling biological growths.\r\nBlood stains.\r\nBrutalist megastructure with oppressive, claustrophobic spaces.\r\nPsychological dread: Flickering lights, distant whispers, and unpredictable sound design.\r\nEnvironmental storytelling with implied violence and tragic lore.\r\nSyringe-based mechanics (extracting fluids from grotesque organisms).\r\nJump Scares.\r\nRare, but impactful audio/visual shocks (e.g., sudden bangs, machinery activating)."
    },
